    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a perilous dungeon where the dead don\u2019t stay dead. In this fast-paced, low-poly first-person shooter, you play as a goblin thief caught in the wrong place at the wrong time. Survive endless waves of armed skeletons, scavenge for loot, and unlock powerful upgrades. Collect artifacts and rare items that you can later showcase and sell in your very own shop.\u00a0Can you hustle your way to the top, or will the dungeon drag you down to the dirt?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horde Survival</strong> \u2013 Battle relentless waves of undead enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Economy</strong> \u2013 Collect money, buy upgrades, and unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong> \u2013 Tight gunplay and movement mechanics for an intense FPS experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stash &amp; Sell Loot</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Manage your inventory and attract customer while upgrading your store.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the game on YouTube, X, and Reddit\u00a0to stay up to date on the game's development</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a perilous dungeon where the dead don\u2019t stay dead. In this fast-paced, low-poly first-person shooter, you play as a goblin thief caught in the wrong place at the wrong time. Survive endless waves of armed skeletons, scavenge for loot, and unlock powerful upgrades. Collect artifacts and rare items that you can later showcase and sell in your very own shop.\u00a0Can you hustle your way to the top, or will the dungeon drag you down to the dirt?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horde Survival</strong> \u2013 Battle relentless waves of undead enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Economy</strong> \u2013 Collect money, buy upgrades, and unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong> \u2013 Tight gunplay and movement mechanics for an intense FPS experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stash &amp; Sell Loot</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Manage your inventory and attract customer while upgrading your store.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the game on YouTube, X, and Reddit\u00a0to stay up to date on the game's development</p>",
